      "summary_html": "<p>What do AI-native companies actually do differently? Drawing on examples from Stripe, Shopify, Uber, Ramp, and others, NLW breaks down seven practices that turn agents into useful systems\u2014from shared company context and automatically triggered work to verification and human accountability. Plus, why the \u201cAI teammate\u201d model may be giving way to something more effective: flexible groups of agents organized around the work, rather than a fixed roster of digital coworkers.</p><p><strong>Check out How We Got Here Ep. 3 - How Gambling on Everything From Our Phones Became Normal </strong></p><p><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/4OHJ8GCtbEoAcSHsDT2Byr?si=B7qP-oAGS6SNRoPEGXGC7A\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://open.spotify.com/episode/4OHJ8GCtbEoAcSHsDT2Byr?si=B7qP-oAGS6SNRoPEGXGC7A\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-gambling-on-everything-from-our-phones-became-normal/id6822359990?i=1000800740286\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/how-gambling-on-everything-from-our-phones-became-normal/id6822359990?i=1000800740286\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Learn More about the AI Champions Program: </strong><a href=\"https://www.besuper.ai/champions\">\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060https://www.besuper.ai/champions\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060\u2060</a></p><p><strong>Brought to you by:</strong></p><p><strong>KPMG</strong> \u2013 New KPMG and UT Austin research shows what separates \u201cAI Amplifiers\u201d from everyone else. Learn more at <a href=\"https://kpmg.com/us/en/articles/2026/ai-redefining-career-success-empower-your-talent-thrive.html?utm_source=t